תֵן למלכים 144:10 ; so in phrase ׳חֵץתֿ ליהוה 2Kin 13:17 , ׳חֵץתֿ בַּאֲרָם 13:17 ; of national deliverance , from exile, ת יִשְׂרָאֵל ׳נוֺשַׁע עולמים Isa 45:17 (Da Synt.:§ 67 b ), 46:13 (|| צְדָקָה ), 46:13 (with נתן ; || תִּפְאֶרֶת ); in General of national success and prosperity Jer 3:23 ; Prov 11:14 = 24:6 ; of deliverance from personal trouble Psa 37:39 ; Lam 3:26 ( י ׳תְּשׁוּעַת ) or of national deliverance under figure of personal Psa 40:11 (|| אֱמוּנָָֽתְךָ ), 40:17 ; 71:15 (|| צְדָקָח ), so ׳י תְּשׁוּעָתִי Psalm 38:23; contrasted with ׳י s deliverance is אָדָם תְּשׁוּעַת deliverance of (through) man Psalm 60:13 = 108:13 , compare 146:3 . 2 more exclusively spiritual in sense , = salvation , appear to be תְשׁוּעָתִי אֱלֹהֵי Psa 51:16 ; 119:41 (|| חֲסָדֶךָ ), Psalm 51:81, and ת יִלְבְּשׁוּ ׳כֹּהֲנֶיךָ 2Chr 6:41 (from יֵשַׁע אלברשׁ כהניה Psa 132:16 ).","rootNote":"or תְּשֻׁעָה ; from 7768 in the sense of 3467 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 11 14","keyReferences":["1Chr 11 14","1Chr 19 12","1Sam 11 9","1Sam 11 13","1Sam 19 5","2Chr 6 41","2Kgs 5 1","2Kgs 13 17"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":34,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 11 14","book":"1Chr","chapter":11,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּשׁוּעָ֥ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 19 12","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":12,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/תְשׁוּעָ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 11 9","book":"1Sam","chapter":11,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּשׁוּעָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 11 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":11,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּשׁוּעָ֖ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 19 5","book":"1Sam","chapter":19,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"תְּשׁוּעָ֤ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 6 41","book"